{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01L6JM1aHdJZpxbtXVc8PjTW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a complete picture. I can see:\n1. Existing Instagram tables: `instagram_post_queue`, `instagram_post_performance`, `instagram_posting_model`, `instagram_publisher_config`\n2. Existing patterns for supabase, openai, cron auth, etc.\n3. The vercel.json structure\n\nNow I need to implement the 20 features. Let me start with **ACE-001: Database Schema Migration**.\n\nThe required tables are:\n1. content_signals\n2. content_strategy_briefs\n3. content_candidates\n4. content_copy_variants\n5. content_templates\n6. content_assets\n7. post_queue\n8. published_posts\n9. post_performance\n10. model_weights\n11. job_runs\n\nI need to also seed:\n- model_weights with default scoring weights\n- content_templates with 5 initial templates\n\nLet me start by applying the migrations.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2597,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6006,"cache_read_input_tokens":55509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6006},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3ca29b94-4e19-4a86-9fa5-c871da6b8f97","uuid":"d2e04e4d-ca32-41f0-a410-22edcfc0bd27"}
