{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01STndBbtPgMNY1FmMiGKEUR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J69CNiCx4LFhe4a6aK2hsx","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/isaiahdupree/Documents/Software/EverReachOrganized/backend/backend-vercel/app/api/v1/content/health/route.ts","content":"/**\n * Content Engine Health Endpoint\n * GET /api/v1/content/health\n *\n * Checks: Supabase connectivity, OpenAI API key, content_templates count,\n * active model_weights exists\n */\n\nimport { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\nimport { getServiceClient } from '@/lib/supabase';\n\nexport const runtime = 'nodejs';\n\nexport async function GET() {\n  try {\n    const supabase = getServiceClient();\n    const issues = [];\n\n    // 1. Check Supabase connectivity\n    const { data: templateCount, error: countErr } = await supabase\n      .from('content_templates')\n      .select('id', { count: 'exact', head: true });\n\n    if (countErr || !templateCount || templateCount.length === 0) {\n      issues.push('Supabase connectivity failed or no templates found');\n    }\n\n    // 2. Check OpenAI API key\n    const apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY;\n    if (!apiKey) {\n      issues.push('OPENAI_API_KEY not configured');\n    }\n\n    // 3. Check active model weights\n    const { data: activeWeights, error: weightsErr } = await supabase\n      .from('model_weights')\n      .select('id')\n      .eq('is_active', true)\n      .single();\n\n    if (weightsErr || !activeWeights) {\n      issues.push('No active model_weights found');\n    }\n\n    const isHealthy = issues.length === 0;\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      {\n        ok: isHealthy,\n        supabase: 'connected',\n        openai_key: apiKey ? 'present' : 'missing',\n        templates: templateCount?.length || 0,\n        model_weights: activeWeights ? 'active' : 'missing',\n        issues: issues.length > 0 ? issues : undefined,\n      },\n      { status: isHealthy ? 200 : 503 }\n    );\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Health check failed:', error);\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { ok: false, error: String(error), issues: ['Unexpected error during health check'] },\n      { status: 503 }\n    );\n  }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1346,"cache_read_input_tokens":138651,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1346},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb4472d8-2d98-4b2e-984c-a22e7f287505","uuid":"376b8ffa-1671-4b27-9caa-4551c5be4eb9"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J69CNiCx4LFhe4a6aK2hsx","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/isaiahdupree/Documents/Software/EverReachOrganized/backend/backend-vercel/app/api/v1/content/health/route.ts"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb4472d8-2d98-4b2e-984c-a22e7f287505","uuid":"4e337299-a43a-42bb-9f3a-f81169b2d3da","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/isaiahdupree/Documents/Software/EverReachOrganized/backend/backend-vercel/app/api/v1/content/health/route.ts","content":"/**\n * Content Engine Health Endpoint\n * GET /api/v1/content/health\n *\n * Checks: Supabase connectivity, OpenAI API key, content_templates count,\n * active model_weights exists\n */\n\nimport { NextResponse } from 'next/server';\nimport { getServiceClient } from '@/lib/supabase';\n\nexport const runtime = 'nodejs';\n\nexport async function GET() {\n  try {\n    const supabase = getServiceClient();\n    const issues = [];\n\n    // 1. Check Supabase connectivity\n    const { data: templateCount, error: countErr } = await supabase\n      .from('content_templates')\n      .select('id', { count: 'exact', head: true });\n\n    if (countErr || !templateCount || templateCount.length === 0) {\n      issues.push('Supabase connectivity failed or no templates found');\n    }\n\n    // 2. Check OpenAI API key\n    const apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY;\n    if (!apiKey) {\n      issues.push('OPENAI_API_KEY not configured');\n    }\n\n    // 3. Check active model weights\n    const { data: activeWeights, error: weightsErr } = await supabase\n      .from('model_weights')\n      .select('id')\n      .eq('is_active', true)\n      .single();\n\n    if (weightsErr || !activeWeights) {\n      issues.push('No active model_weights found');\n    }\n\n    const isHealthy = issues.length === 0;\n\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      {\n        ok: isHealthy,\n        supabase: 'connected',\n        openai_key: apiKey ? 'present' : 'missing',\n        templates: templateCount?.length || 0,\n        model_weights: activeWeights ? 'active' : 'missing',\n        issues: issues.length > 0 ? issues : undefined,\n      },\n      { status: isHealthy ? 200 : 503 }\n    );\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Health check failed:', error);\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { ok: false, error: String(error), issues: ['Unexpected error during health check'] },\n      { status: 503 }\n    );\n  }\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_017gg3V3XH74mYiuw9YWsg6i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to implement:\n- ACE-018: Evergreen Fallback Posts (seed data)\n- ACE-019: E2E Test script\n- ACE-020: Deploy\n\nFor ACE-018, I need to seed 15 posts into the post_queue table with real captions. Let me do this as a migration or API endpoint that can be called.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. ACE-018 is about seeding 15 evergreen posts. I can do this with a migration or by creating an endpoint that seeds them.\n\nLet me create an endpoint that can be called to seed the data, or I could just add the seed data to a migration. I'll create an endpoint that can be called.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":977,"cache_read_input_tokens":139997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":977},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb4472d8-2d98-4b2e-984c-a22e7f287505","uuid":"8b4f6bf8-10f4-4e5a-a0a6-afbb1026f629"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_017gg3V3XH74mYiuw9YWsg6i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now **ACE-018 (Evergreen Fallback Posts)** — I'll create a migration to seed these:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":977,"cache_read_input_tokens":139997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":977},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb4472d8-2d98-4b2e-984c-a22e7f287505","uuid":"8196f8d4-e7cb-4060-a8bd-292cda24ce17"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_017gg3V3XH74mYiuw9YWsg6i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KGsmf8Aq5KbztRh5owbdY6","name":"mcp__supabase__apply_migration","input":{"name":"seed_evergreen_posts","query":"\nINSERT INTO post_queue (\n  queue_status, \n  queue_source, \n  caption, \n  metadata, \n  auto_schedule\n) VALUES\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Why do friendships fade after college? It''s not laziness—it''s friction. You go from daily interaction to zero structure. No classes forcing you together, no dorm hallway encounters, no shared calendar. The intimacy of friendship requires *proximity*. The good news? You can rebuild it intentionally. EverReach helps you nurture relationships that matter.', '{\"pillar\":\"friendship_fade\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'The loneliest feeling? Having 500 connections and nobody to text at 11pm. Modern friendship is broken. We optimized for quantity, lost quality. Adult friendship is hard because nobody teaches you how to maintain it. It takes intentional effort. Most people give up. If you don''t want to be alone, you have to be different. EverReach makes it simple.', '{\"pillar\":\"adult_friendship_psychology\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'You can''t manage relationships you don''t track. Think about it: you track calories, workouts, spending—but not the humans who matter most. No wonder relationships fade. You have no system. No data. No reason to stay consistent. That''s the gap EverReach fills. Make relationship health as easy as fitness.', '{\"pillar\":\"relationship_systems\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Your friendships have a health score, but you''ll never see it. They slowly fade while you''re not looking. The warmth dies quietly. By the time you realize, you''re strangers. What if you could see it coming? What if you had a system to prevent it? That''s the EverReach difference. See it. Fix it. Keep what matters.', '{\"pillar\":\"warmth_score\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Reaching out after months of silence feels scary. Will they remember you? Will they think it''s weird? This paralysis keeps people isolated. But connection wants to happen. You just need the courage to start. EverReach gives you that nudge—at the right time, with the right context. Make reconnection feel natural again.', '{\"pillar\":\"outreach_intelligence\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Most people don''t understand relationship maintenance until they''ve already lost important people. Then they''re desperate to learn. We built EverReach for the people who want to learn before it''s too late. Master the 8 pillars of relationship health. Future-proof your friendships.', '{\"pillar\":\"product_education\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Why should you trust an app with your relationships? Because a system beats chaos. Because data beats gut feel. Because EverReach is built by people who care about this stuff—not just another feature in a bloated social platform. Your friendships deserve better. They deserve privacy, intention, and science.', '{\"pillar\":\"proof_and_trust\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'The cost of loneliness is higher than you think. Health impacts, mental health decline, shorter lifespan. Investing in friendships isn''t selfishness—it''s the best investment you''ll ever make. EverReach makes that investment effortless. Better life starts with better relationships.', '{\"pillar\":\"conversion\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'That friend from high school you used to talk to every day? You could have them back. Not out of nostalgia, but because genuine connection doesn''t die—it just gets dormant. All it takes is one brave message. One intentional step. Let EverReach help you take it.', '{\"pillar\":\"friendship_fade\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Friendship anxiety is real. Wondering if you''ll bother someone by reaching out. Worried about what to say. These are normal fears in adult life. But they''re keeping you from the people who actually want to hear from you. EverReach breaks through the noise. Your real friends are waiting.', '{\"pillar\":\"adult_friendship_psychology\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', '8 pillars of friendship health: Friendship Fade, Relationship Systems, Warmth Score, Outreach Intelligence, Adult Friendship Psychology, Product Education, Proof & Trust, Conversion. Master them all in EverReach. Build unbreakable relationships.', '{\"pillar\":\"relationship_systems\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'The data is clear: people with strong friendships live longer, happier, more resilient lives. But most of us don''t have a system for building them. We just hope it works out. Hope is not a strategy. EverReach is.', '{\"pillar\":\"warmth_score\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Timing matters more than you think. Reaching out on someone''s bad week vs. good week changes everything. EverReach learns the best times to connect you with the people who matter. Smarter outreach. Better responses. Stronger bonds.', '{\"pillar\":\"outreach_intelligence\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'We designed EverReach because we watched friendships die. Good friendships. Not from malice—just from neglect and bad timing. We knew there had to be a better way. Now there is. Join thousands who are reclaiming their relationships.', '{\"pillar\":\"proof_and_trust\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true),\n  ('queued', 'evergreen_seed', 'Your best year ever starts with better relationships. Stronger friendships = better mental health = better everything. Invest in EverReach. Invest in yourself. Watch everything else improve.', '{\"pillar\":\"conversion\",\"format\":\"static_truth\"}', true)\nON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":977,"cache_read_input_tokens":139997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":977},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb4472d8-2d98-4b2e-984c-a22e7f287505","uuid":"40db309d-b16f-4baf-8101-f4f6212eb7f1"}
