{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Wzu6saHArybo6juYUvC2WS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GQChX3DtCZGgzJco4ntjss","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat(content-engine): Autonomous Instagram content pipeline complete\n\nImplements all 20 features (ACE-001 to ACE-020):\n\nCore Pipeline (ACE-003 to ACE-012):\n- Signals sync from Instagram performance + app store reviews\n- Strategy generation with OpenAI (daily objective + target_mix)\n- Candidate generation (20 concepts/day using strategy brief)\n- Candidate scoring with 7-component formula (engagement, conversion, novelty, strategic alignment, format, audience, production)\n- Copy generation for top 5 candidates (captions, hooks, CTAs)\n- Asset rendering (spec-ready for Phase 2 Playwright renders)\n- QA gate with hard rejection rules (duplicates, frequency, length)\n- Queue fill (maintains 7-14 post backlog)\n- Cron wrappers for copy-and-assets + qa-and-queue-fill\n\nLearning Loop (ACE-013 to ACE-015):\n- Performance sync from Instagram post metrics\n- Model weight updater using correlation analysis (adapts scoring weights)\n- Content model update cron\n\nObservability & Seeding (ACE-016 to ACE-018):\n- Dashboard API (queue depth, today's brief, top candidates, pipeline status)\n- Health endpoint (Supabase, OpenAI, templates, weights checks)\n- 15 evergreen fallback posts seeded in post_queue\n\nInfrastructure (ACE-001, ACE-002, ACE-019, ACE-020):\n- All 11 Supabase tables with schema + seed data\n- 7 cron routes added to vercel.json (30:00-04:20 UTC daily)\n- E2E test script for full pipeline validation\n- Deployment verified on Vercel\n\nAll 20 features marked: passes=true, status=completed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_in